stateDiagram-v2
    state "ACTIVE" as Active
    state "SOFT_DELETED" as SoftDeleted

    [*] --> Active : createProfileForUser tạo Profile (status mặc định ACTIVE)
    Active --> Active : updateProfileSettings đổi name banner logo portalAccent (chỉ OWNER)
    Active --> SoftDeleted : deleteProfileAction (OWNER) đặt deletedAt + hardDeleteAfter 30 ngày
    SoftDeleted --> Active : restoreProfileAction (OWNER) xóa deletedAt + hardDeleteAfter
    SoftDeleted --> [*] : cron hard-delete-profiles chạy khi quá hardDeleteAfter (profile.delete cascade workspaces)

%% Object: Profile (vòng đời branding/settings của flow P8 — object chính có lifecycle rõ nhất)
